===== ShanulWp-theme =======

Contributors: mahdi davoodi
Tags: woocommerce, rtl, responsive, mega-menu, wishlist, like-dislike, bookmark, faq, blog, magazine, news, video, photography, gallery, ecommerce, customizer, seo, translation-ready
Requires at least: 6.4
Tested up to: 6.9.1
Requires PHP: 7.4
Stable tag: 1.0.0
